; 6. Inbound PIC telegrams (2-digit $17/$18 and 3-digit $017/$018)
; D2 01 03 04 C0 12 20 05  -> Heat Manual 16.0C, flags=05 (*4*21* + *4*31* battery fault)
; D2 01 03 04 C0 22 28 01  -> Cool Manual 20.0C, flags=01 (*4*21*)
; D2 01 03 04 C0 11 02 0D  -> Heat Weekly Prog 3 (1103), flags=0D (21 + 31 + 22 local OFF)
; D2 01 03 04 C0 16 00 05  -> Heat OFF (103), flags=05
